       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. REDEFINESVARIANT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 TRANSACTION-BUFFER.
           05 TRANS-TYPE PIC X(1).
           05 TRANS-DATA PIC X(19).
       01 DEPOSIT-RECORD REDEFINES TRANSACTION-BUFFER.
           05 DEP-TYPE PIC X(1).
           05 DEP-ACCOUNT PIC 9(6).
           05 DEP-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99.
           05 FILLER PIC X(4).
       01 WITHDRAWAL-RECORD REDEFINES TRANSACTION-BUFFER.
           05 WD-TYPE PIC X(1).
           05 WD-ACCOUNT PIC 9(6).
           05 WD-AMOUNT PIC 9(7)V99.
           05 WD-FEE PIC 9(2)V99.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE "D" TO DEP-TYPE
           MOVE 123456 TO DEP-ACCOUNT
           MOVE 1500.00 TO DEP-AMOUNT
           DISPLAY "TRANSACTION TYPE: " TRANS-TYPE
           DISPLAY "DEPOSIT ACCOUNT: " DEP-ACCOUNT
           DISPLAY "DEPOSIT AMOUNT: " DEP-AMOUNT

           MOVE "W" TO WD-TYPE
           MOVE 654321 TO WD-ACCOUNT
           MOVE 250.00 TO WD-AMOUNT
           MOVE 1.50 TO WD-FEE
           DISPLAY "TRANSACTION TYPE: " TRANS-TYPE
           DISPLAY "WITHDRAWAL ACCOUNT: " WD-ACCOUNT
           DISPLAY "WITHDRAWAL AMOUNT: " WD-AMOUNT
           DISPLAY "WITHDRAWAL FEE: " WD-FEE
           STOP RUN.
